{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is Interesting</strong> is a psychological horror narrative based game with roguelite elements. You are being watched, and you aren't really sure why. Delve through the depths of memory to uncover the mystery behind the gray purgatory you find yourself in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640750/extras/3.png?t=1744040813\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple Playthroughs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Subsequent playthroughs give further clues about the mysterious nature of the cyclical prison you find yourself in, and any number of these hints can point you towards the game's 6 endings, all culminating in the actual ending of the story. There isn't really a New Game+, as every further playthrough adds to the game each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640750/extras/Untitled-2.png?t=1744040813\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hidden Stats</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your decisions are tracked throughout the game via stats, and these stats drastically alter the way the game can end. You'll have to experiment with every type of choice in order to see everything the story has to offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640750/extras/4.jpg?t=1744040813\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive Sound</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featuring a custom soundtrack and uneasy ambience, you'll never feel quite safe roaming the halls of this prison.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3640750?t=1744040813","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3640750?t=1744040813","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640750/1d16a97cea1cd7a04da3b4d3a2a3aeb6b9032142/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744040813","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640750/1d16a97cea1cd7a04da3b4d3a2a3aeb6b9032142/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744040813","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":"Game depicts one character potentially jumping off a building if he is not convinced to do otherwise."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is Interesting</strong> is a psychological horror narrative based game with roguelite elements. You are being watched, and you aren't really sure why. Delve through the depths of memory to uncover the mystery behind the gray purgatory you find yourself in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640750/extras/3.png?t=1744040813\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple Playthroughs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Subsequent playthroughs give further clues about the mysterious nature of the cyclical prison you find yourself in, and any number of these hints can point you towards the game's 6 endings, all culminating in the actual ending of the story. There isn't really a New Game+, as every further playthrough adds to the game each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640750/extras/Untitled-2.png?t=1744040813\" /></p><p class=\"bb_par